# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>   ← 72 chars max, imperative mood
#
# Types  (required):
#   feat      New feature visible to users
#   fix       Bug fix
#   refactor  Code restructure with no behaviour change
#   style     Formatting / whitespace / linting only
#   test      Add or update tests
#   docs      Documentation only
#   chore     Maintenance (deps, config, tooling)
#   perf      Performance improvement
#   ci        CI/CD pipeline changes
#   build     Build system changes (vite, tsconfig…)
#   revert    Reverts a previous commit
#
# Scopes (optional, pick the most specific):
#   auth        Authentication / session / login / signup
#   food        Food items, DAOs, server functions
#   profile     User profile / personal details
#   daily-log   Daily log entries and totals
#   db          Migrations, schema, DAOs
#   ui          Components, styles, ShadCN
#   api         Server functions / route handlers
#   config      Env, biome, tsconfig, vite, docker
#
# Body (optional — leave a blank line after subject):
#   Explain WHY, not HOW. Wrap at 72 chars.
#
# Examples:
#   feat(food): add protein/carbs/fat fields to food form
#   fix(auth): redirect to login when session expires
#   chore(config): upgrade biome to v2.4.13
#   refactor(db): extract category DAO to separate file
